# === Secrets & credentials =================================================
# This repo auto-commits and pushes to a PUBLIC GitHub remote every few hours
# (see sync.sh / launchagents). Anything tracked becomes world-readable, so keep
# credential material and machine-local overrides OUT by default.
*.local
!*.local.example          # keep committed *.local.example templates
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.gpg
*.asc
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
credentials
*credentials*
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
service-account*.json
*-key.json
.secret
*.secret
secrets.*